%% UC-01 Place a morning pre-order — transaction T1 (SDD §4.4, Figure 3)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant UI as Customer UI
  participant API as /customer/orders (route)
  participant AUTH as Auth & Access Control
  participant OM as Order Management
  participant CC as Customer Component
  participant PAY as Payment Component
  participant DB as Repositories (SQLite)
  participant EV as Notifications (Observer)

  C->>UI: choose items, payment method
  UI->>API: POST order + Idempotency-Key
  API->>AUTH: authenticate + requireRole(CUSTOMER)
  AUTH-->>API: principal
  API->>API: validate body (zod) — VAL-001
  API->>OM: submitOrder(principal, cart)
  OM->>DB: idempotency lookup
  rect rgb(255, 246, 220)
    note over OM,DB: T1 — one SQLite transaction, all or nothing
    OM->>CC: assertMembership (BR-04, BR-16)
    OM->>DB: read restaurant + deadline
    OM->>OM: assertInServiceArea (FR-32, BR-17) — ORDER-003
    OM->>OM: evaluateDeadline (BR-01) — ORDER-001
    OM->>PAY: assertMethodAvailable (FR-25/26)
    OM->>DB: read item availability (BR-02) — ORDER-002, same restaurant (I-5)
    OM->>DB: insert order (total, deadline snapshot D-04)
    OM->>DB: insert order items (price snapshot D-02)
    OM->>PAY: recordAtCheckout(order) (I-3)
    PAY->>DB: insert payment row (strategy: cash PENDING / e-payment capture)
  end
  OM-->>API: order view
  OM-)EV: OrderSubmitted, OrderConfirmed (after commit, D-08)
  EV-)UI: SSE to this restaurant's staff and this customer only (BR-15)
  API-->>UI: 201 Created, order FG-XXXXXX
  UI-->>C: confirmation + order progress
